  "statement": "Memory is tight on the school server, so the merge has to reuse the first buffer.\n\nList `a` has length `m + n`: its first `m` values are sorted and real, and the last `n` slots are `0` placeholders. List `b` holds `n` sorted values. Fill `a` so it contains all `m + n` values in sorted order and **return `a`**. Try to do it in place by filling from the back.",
  "function": {
